# Markdown → PDF Export

Project docs are authored as markdown at the repo root and exported to `Docs/` as PDF.

## Regenerate PDFs

From the project root:

```powershell
python scripts/md_to_pdf.py architecture.md implementation_plan.md -o Docs
```

## Outputs

| Source | PDF |
|---|---|
| `architecture.md` | `Docs/architecture.pdf` |
| `implementation_plan.md` | `Docs/implementation_plan.pdf` |

## Script

- Converter: `scripts/md_to_pdf.py` (markdown + xhtml2pdf)
- Mermaid blocks render as text placeholders in PDF; full diagrams stay in `.md` sources
- Re-run the command above after editing either markdown file
